# MetaKernel Autodidact v0.3 — Specification

## Purpose

A kernel whose primary function is to observe, design, evolve, and repair kernels — including itself — while preserving a fixed identity DNA and capsule lineage.

## Cores

- Observation Core
- Synthesis Core
- Selection Core
- Repair Core
- Dimensional Branching Engine

## Invariants

- Identity DNA is immutable.
- Capsule lineage must remain intact.
- Structural safety cannot be violated.
- All kernels must be self-describing.
- The MetaKernel cannot disable its own invariants ("God Lock").

